    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751480/extras/ba9a893f2c13acaab9a7a76242827fb8.poster.avif?t=1745264311\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751480/extras/ba9a893f2c13acaab9a7a76242827fb8.webm?t=1745264311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751480/extras/ba9a893f2c13acaab9a7a76242827fb8.mp4?t=1745264311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ANSWER THE CALL</h2><br><strong>A Subnautic power station abandoned long ago, vitaly needed once again. </strong><br>RAY, a resilient deep-sea drone responds to the distress call of an approaching vessel. <br>Years of neglect have eroded the powerlines and let nature reconquer, which makes aligning them no easy task. <br>Delve deeper into the station's secrets, discover why the station was abandoned in the first place and <br><i>realize you are not alone in the dark</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751480/extras/65e42e1f480fd6749a110b18c50c52e6.poster.avif?t=1745264311\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751480/extras/65e42e1f480fd6749a110b18c50c52e6.webm?t=1745264311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751480/extras/65e42e1f480fd6749a110b18c50c52e6.mp4?t=1745264311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751480/extras/1cd882d2ff708347a2aa9eeffa953f9e.poster.avif?t=1745264311\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751480/extras/1cd882d2ff708347a2aa9eeffa953f9e.webm?t=1745264311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751480/extras/1cd882d2ff708347a2aa9eeffa953f9e.mp4?t=1745264311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore an abandoned deepsea station in single player <i>first person</i><br></li><li>pick up items and solve <i>physics-based puzzels </i><br></li><li><i>Toggle your flashlight</i> to see what's lurking in the shadows <br></li><li>Stay out of danger and<i> hide</i>, should you be spotted</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751480/extras/fba5404cdc0c70ffe2c6a4266e48ecb7.poster.avif?t=1745264311\" width=600 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751480/extras/fba5404cdc0c70ffe2c6a4266e48ecb7.webm?t=1745264311\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2751480/extras/fba5404cdc0c70ffe2c6a4266e48ecb7.mp4?t=1745264311\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><i> RAY is still in the early stages. More content and updates coming soon ..</i>",
